          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations, with the naked eye and then with binoculars, of a moving luminous phenomenon in the sky: observation of the star Sirius during the first observation and the star Arcturus during the second.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "bd4a7f4d6b794ad5959e9565068f8988d78e42f9083580cdd1b761fac5ccb16f"
